 "transnational": true,
 "intro_zh": "新锡德尔湖与费尔特湖地区八千年以来一直是多种文化的汇集地，其风格迥异的景观生动地体现了这一点，也是人类活动和自然环境相互作用的结果。湖区周围奇异的乡村建筑和几座18和19世纪的宫殿为该地区增添了浓厚的文化色彩。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "The Fert ö/Neusiedler Lake area has been the meeting place of different cultures for eight millennia. This is graphically demonstrated by its varied landscape, the result of an evolutionary symbiosis between human activity and the physical environment. The remarkable rural architecture of the villages surrounding the lake and several 18th- and 19th-century palaces adds to the area's considerable cultural interest.",
 "intro_en_source": "unesco_official",
